ing the door.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Distant highway traffic through the fog, a ringing phone, brief breaths, then the old man's quiet exhaling and a faint metal tap.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse piano at a slow tempo joined by sustained low strings that swell faintly when the headlight curls of light appear, then settle back.\\n\\n禁止：台词字幕 / 水印 / UI。\",\"negativePrompt\":\"bad video\",\"taskType\":\"\",\"refs\":[{\"index\":0,\"imageFile\":\"f337ed8b0c444d1fc31351d3d1c78f3d3c7974e75eb096301ff899b5d2a2f897.png\",\"fileName\":\"\",\"type\":\"input\",\"subfolder\":\"\"},{\"index\":1,\"imageFile\":\"b52686d43dc1009ee8d0caf0c3501b3ffb3e2cfc28cdc8af5694e48774a03577.png\",\"fileName\":\"\",\"type\":\"input\",\"subfolder\":\"\"},{\"index\":2,\"imageFile\":\"58951cf0159bbf7b087bf1f005a61c787d2c1e37897de005bcce5496f73c61be.png\",\"fileName\":\"\",\"type\":\"input\",\"subfolder\":\"\"},{\"index\":3,\"imageFile\":\"6f2df7b4dba50473872d310b80ee96dcb960b8e5781a2fd33f927adc0434facb.png\",\"fileName\":\"\",\"type\":\"input\",\"subfolder\":\"\"},{\"index\":4,\"imageFile\":\"5476de3b02f3a47220559f1407b3b85de1f89f23c19cd4b0d2b4567081d8f369.png\",\"fileName\":\"\",\"type\":\"input\",\"subfolder\":\"\"}],\"refAudios\":[],\"refVideos\":[],\"genImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"\"},\"continuityFromPrev\":false,\"refImageSize\":\"match\"}],\"timelineMode\":\"prompt_batch\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":736,\"refMaxSize\":1280,\"gen\":{\"defaultFrameCount\":124},\"keyframes\":[{\"id\":\"msdtx3zi62ktv_s\",\"imageFile\":\"d47f7c7c243b746a437dd33ac21ed163192540329ac0784ed7e6bd83b440065a.png\",\"width\":768,\"height\":1024,\"start\":0,\"length\":62,\"frameCount\":62,\"durationSec\":5,\"prompt\":\"一个猴子在极速奔跑，跑的过程中裤子掉在地上，但他仍然继续奔跑。过程中伴随自然的跑步声\",\"negativePrompt\":\"bad video\",\"isStartFrame\":true,\"isEndFrame\":false},{\"id\":\"msdtx3zi62ktv_e\",\"imageFile\":\"a1f4b9c98491d696b06b022b2588bf82b966a69356edc0fde952ce335820f26c.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":682,\"start\":62,\"length\":62,\